<Project>

  <!--
    Deliberately empty, and load-bearing.

    MSBuild walks upwards for the first Directory.Build.props it finds, so without this file the
    repository's own would reach the fixture and impose TargetFramework net10.0 (the fixture
    multi-targets on purpose), TreatWarningsAsErrors (the fixture contains a deliberate CS0029),
    EnforceCodeStyleInBuild and a NoWarn list. Every one of those would make the fixture a copy of
    this repository's conventions rather than what it is for: an ordinary solution, shaped the way
    somebody else's repository is shaped, that the live tests point a real Roslyn at.

    Nothing may be added here. A property that made the fixture build more cleanly would be a
    property that removed one of the diagnostics the tests assert on.
  -->

</Project>
